# Context filter for packaging/ptar/Dockerfile (BuildKit picks up the
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore sitting next to the Dockerfile, in place of the
# repository root .dockerignore).
#
# The builder only needs what `go build .` reads, so .git -- 130+ MB that would
# otherwise be uploaded on every build -- goes first.  plakar is built with
# -buildvcs=false, so nothing misses it.
.git
.github
.forgejo
.vscode
.goreleaser.yml
.codecov.yml
CHANGELOG.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
README.md
SECURITY.md
docs/
unittests/
testing/
dist/
plakar
**/.DS_Store
